Task 2: Install required packages
Description Task 2: Install the required packages using the package module

Task 3: Configure systemd service
Description Task 3: Configure the systemd service using the template module, only when ansible_service_mgr is "systemd".

Task 4: Configure sysvinit service
Description Task 4: Configure the sysvinit service using the template module, only when ansible_service_mgr is "sysvinit", "upstart", or "openrc".

Task 5: Manage service
